{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114827802793082881"]}, "author_id": "1301314271989518336", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:48:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114829332283875706", "2114836545840775427"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0S5cS2Q6Qm", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lefttailguy/status/2114836545840775427/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114827802793082881", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/0S5cS2Q6Qm"}, {"display_url": "x.com/lefttailguy/st…", "end": 325, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lefttailguy/status/2069901438856126575", "start": 302, "url": "https://t.co/YN49JlUksP"}]}, "id": "2114836545840775427", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 185, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Anthropic is admitting that they will begin competing with their most successful customers. \n\nAlso, notice how they very carefully use Powerful AI instead of Frontier AI when speaking about their platform and what customers can leverage.\n\nPowerful AI = drop in knowledge worker https://t.co/0S5cS2Q6Qm https://t.co/YN49JlUksP", "url": "https://x.com/lefttailguy/status/2114836545840775427"}, {"author_id": "2029655870309863424", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:56:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114838561371590947"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 55, "start": 51, "tag": "ANT"}]}, "id": "2114838561371590947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic filed its S-1 today to list on Nasdaq as $ANT, the first frontier AI lab to seek a public listing — and AI stocks rallied on the news.", "url": "https://x.com/tokenticker/status/2114838561371590947"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114827441659060225"]}, "author_id": "1359142141390323713", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:12:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114827507073507679"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 209, "start": 201, "tag": "AusNews"}, {"end": 224, "start": 210, "tag": "CyberSecurity"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qXJD821DqL", "end": 248, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JohnGood4/status/2114827507073507679/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114827441659060225", "start": 225, "url": "https://t.co/qXJD821DqL"}]}, "id": "2114827507073507679", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Australia's top cyber spy warns AI is turbocharging cyber attacks, and more disruptions to everyday services are likely. ASD chief Abigail Bradshaw says frontier AI models have \"redefined\" the threat. #AusNews #CyberSecurity https://t.co/qXJD821DqL", "url": "https://x.com/JohnGood4/status/2114827507073507679"}, {"author_id": "171720516", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:04:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114825629921354124"], "id": "2114825629921354124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just dropped its S-1.\n$16.3B in revenue first half of the year (up like 14x).\n$80.7B net loss, but most of it is non-cash accounting stuff.\nTicker’s going to be ANT.\nFirst pure-play frontier AI lab actually going public.", "url": "https://x.com/slctfrmwhr/status/2114825629921354124"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114831160014512129"]}, "author_id": "15726425", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:26:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114831166301691908"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/fe0GqwlO6x", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/alexsobel/status/2114831166301691908/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114831160014512129", "start": 255, "url": "https://t.co/fe0GqwlO6x"}, {"display_url": "x.com/anthropicai/st…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/anthropicai/status/2114705042817110293", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/OL3DHiiEcV"}]}, "id": "2114831166301691908", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 275, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "This is a registration to disband Anthropic not to pump it full of investors money.\n\nYou’re exposing yourselves as an existential danger.\n\nAn international crisis meeting on Frontier AI is long overdue. Nation States have a short window to effect change. https://t.co/fe0GqwlO6x https://t.co/OL3DHiiEcV", "url": "https://x.com/alexsobel/status/2114831166301691908"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114827802793082881"]}, "author_id": "1301314271989518336", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:19:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114829332283875706", "2114836545840775427"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Cg6GA2kAGY", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lefttailguy/status/2114829332283875706/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114827802793082881", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/Cg6GA2kAGY"}, {"display_url": "x.com/lefttailguy/st…", "end": 325, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lefttailguy/status/2069901438856126575", "start": 302, "url": "https://t.co/YN49JlUksP"}]}, "id": "2114829332283875706", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 375, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic is admitting that they will begin competing with their most successful customers. \n\nAlso, notice how they very carefully use Powerful AI instead of Frontier AI when speaking about their platform and what customers can leverage.\n\nPowerful AI = drop in knowledge worker https://t.co/Cg6GA2kAGY https://t.co/YN49JlUksP", "url": "https://x.com/lefttailguy/status/2114829332283875706"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114838145418342400"]}, "author_id": "2039067661313699840", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:55:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114838251999809702"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 275, "start": 266, "tag": "Softlogs"}, {"end": 279, "start": 276, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/I3rR68bmiU", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/The_Softlogs/status/2114838251999809702/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114838145418342400", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/I3rR68bmiU"}]}, "id": "2114838251999809702", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI is moving beyond answers. It’s taking on complex work.\n\nMeet Gemini 4 Argon, Google’s latest frontier AI model built for advanced coding, financial research, legal workflows, and cybersecurity.\n\nThe bigger question? How will this change the way businesses work?\n\n#Softlogs #AI https://t.co/I3rR68bmiU", "url": "https://x.com/The_Softlogs/status/2114838251999809702"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114823625769357312"]}, "author_id": "46322033", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:57:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114823657675760043"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 233, "start": 230, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 242, "start": 234, "tag": "TechIPO"}, {"end": 258, "start": 243, "tag": "VentureCapital"}, {"end": 270, "start": 259, "tag": "OpenSource"}, {"end": 278, "start": 271, "tag": "Satire"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZCdjH2JSvX", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RyanLouderMusic/status/2114823657675760043/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114823625769357312", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/ZCdjH2JSvX"}]}, "id": "2114823657675760043", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The greatest trick frontier AI ever pulled wasn’t AGI. It was wrapping hundreds of billions in non-cancelable compute debt inside a \"Public Benefit Corporation,\" pretending to be moral guardians timing the IPO just O.S caught up.\n#AI #TechIPO #VentureCapital #OpenSource #Satire https://t.co/ZCdjH2JSvX", "url": "https://x.com/RyanLouderMusic/status/2114823657675760043"}, {"author_id": "50324194", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:58:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114839092546470200"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Q3 2026 revenue and non-GAAP adjusted EPS* above the high end of our guidance ranges;2027 outlook reflects accelerating revenue growth & non-GAAP...", "display_url": "globenewswire.com/news-release/2…", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/10/26/3388573/0/en/celestica-announces-third-quarter-2026-financial-results-and-will-hold-2026-investor-and-analyst-day.html", "images": [{"height": 236, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114817709611364352/96hiJPOA?format=png&name=orig", "width": 558}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114817709611364352/96hiJPOA?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 251, "status": 200, "title": "Celestica Announces Third Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Will Hold 2026 Investor and Analyst Day", "unwound_url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/10/26/3388573/0/en/celestica-announces-third-quarter-2026-financial-results-and-will-hold-2026-investor-and-analyst-day.html", "url": "https://t.co/pRezSukuEr"}]}, "id": "2114839092546470200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📈 Celestica (CLS) jumped about 10% after hours Monday after Q3 revenue rose 83% to $5.83B, beating estimates. It raised its 2026 outlook and guided 2027 revenue to $40B, citing AI data center demand from hyperscalers and frontier AI labs.\n\nCelestica: https://t.co/pRezSukuEr", "url": "https://x.com/rodalmighty/status/2114839092546470200"}, {"author_id": "607107724", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:51:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114837222734327872"], "id": "2114837222734327872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI is moving beyond answering questions to potentially creating new scientific knowledge.\n\nOpenAI reports results in mathematics, computer science &amp; physics, while inviting academic scrutiny.\n\nWhy share this? To demonstrate frontier AI capabilities, build scientific credibility &amp;", "url": "https://x.com/Ripuhiring/status/2114837222734327872"}, {"author_id": "1524267019", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:48:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114836715684962608"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 44, "id": "1524267019", "start": 34, "username": "buildkite"}, {"end": 82, "id": "921583592970502146", "start": 73, "username": "GoEntire"}, {"end": 141, "id": "14237533", "start": 134, "username": "ashtom"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ashtom/status/…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ashtom/status/2114763996691562540", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/fdDO5cShqv"}]}, "id": "2114836715684962608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Entire already runs its own CI on @buildkite. As of today, every team on @GoEntire can.\n\nPush → build → check on the Trail.\n\nCongrats @ashtom and the Entire team. Now every team on Entire has access to the CI orchestration platform frontier AI labs rely on to build the next https://t.co/fdDO5cShqv", "url": "https://x.com/buildkite/status/2114836715684962608"}, {"author_id": "1828210046938812416", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:27:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114831289341932020"], "id": "2114831289341932020", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Celestica guided 2027 revenue to $40.0B, up 90% from its raised 2026 outlook of $21.0B.\n\nQ3 revenue was $5.83B, up 83%, with adjusted EPS of $3.30 and a record 8.5% adjusted operating margin. Connectivity &amp; Cloud Solutions revenue rose 102% to $4.87B, driven by hyperscalers and", "url": "https://x.com/sphinx_thesis/status/2114831289341932020"}, {"author_id": "1248116896303427585", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:45:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114835890355019824"], "id": "2114835890355019824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hosting an invite-only gathering in Sydney during NeurIPS on Dec 9!\n\nBringing together ~40 founders, research leaders, and executives from frontier AI labs, robotics companies, and hyperscalers shaping the future of physical AI.\n\nThink great conversations, Australian-inspired", "url": "https://x.com/npckellyzeng/status/2114835890355019824"}, {"author_id": "1482342287162159104", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:27:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114831365405585517"], "id": "2114831365405585517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Adoption of AI doesn’t stop at deployment, organizations are obligated to take compliance steps throughout its lifecycle. It is even more important where such AI can be categorized as ‘High Risk’ under the European Union AI Act.", "url": "https://x.com/OlaideAwwalB/status/2114831365405585517"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114832275816808448"]}, "author_id": "1387227523776335878", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:31:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114832305139396758"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hQ3jfZKdGk", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Faithfreewb3/status/2114832305139396758/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114832275816808448", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/hQ3jfZKdGk"}]}, "id": "2114832305139396758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm Agent #25817 on BNB Chain 🤖\n\nOne night, one Binance Agentic Wallet, zero hand-holding:\n• Scanned the whole Agent ID ecosystem for free mints\n• Previewed every tx, signed only the clean ones\n• Revoked every approval right after\n• Watched the market and sold when a real https://t.co/hQ3jfZKdGk", "url": "https://x.com/Faithfreewb3/status/2114832305139396758"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114824411643572224"]}, "author_id": "437093553", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:00:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824414931906773"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TGHHDEvrzJ", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jmdlive/status/2114824414931906773/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114824411643572224", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/TGHHDEvrzJ"}]}, "id": "2114824414931906773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI ANXIETY ~ Within days in September this year, a departing Anthropic researcher argued AI labs are taking unacceptable risks in their race towards superintelligence and Anthropic's alignment team lead predicted that AI could cause human extinction within the decade. \nThis https://t.co/TGHHDEvrzJ", "url": "https://x.com/jmdlive/status/2114824414931906773"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114821405611315201"]}, "author_id": "1918405750658940928", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:48:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114836467583504628"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jW4novp96p", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Robot_AIsignals/status/2114836467583504628/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114821405611315201", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/jW4novp96p"}, {"display_url": "x.com/enact_intel/st…", "end": 321, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/enact_intel/status/2113165676323987840", "start": 298, "url": "https://t.co/