 subject to applicable data-use, privacy and", "url": "https://x.com/Pradeep891730/status/2114824397605265863"}, {"author_id": "1202575908990832640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:36:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114833599862071498"], "id": "2114833599862071498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌆 Market News Digest\n[Oct 26, 2026, EST]\n\n🔥 Top Stories\n• Anthropic IPO buzz + $63B AI financing with Broadcom/BofA/Blackstone — reignites AI trade; semis rally on spending hopes\n• US, Canada near deal to ease steel and auto tariffs — trade tension may cool; key for autos,", "url": "https://x.com/Geo_News_Alert_/status/2114833599862071498"}, {"author_id": "1942214670393176064", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114832078470631857"], "id": "2114832078470631857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 284, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌆 Market News Digest\n[Oct 26, 2026, EST]\n\n🔥 Top Stories\n• Anthropic IPO buzz + $63B AI financing with Broadcom/BofA/Blackstone — reignites AI trade; semis rally on spending hopes\n• US, Canada near deal to ease steel and auto tariffs — trade tension may cool; key for autos,", "url": "https://x.com/MarketNews_Feed/status/2114832078470631857"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114827802793082881", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114827441659060225", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114831160014512129", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114838145418342400", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2114823625769357312", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114832275816808448", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114824411643572224", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114821405611315201", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "1301314271989518336", "name": "illiquid", "username": "lefttailguy"}, {"i